{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Sakura Wars: The Gorgeous Blooming Cherry Blossoms","The year is around the 1920's and the darkness of the demons have arrived. Now, only the people with large amounts of spirit energy can save the Earth. The Flower Division is now going to be sent out destroy the demons for they're our only hope for survival with their new steam-powered machines and unique fighting techniques.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["サクラ大戦 ~桜華絢爛~",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":1166,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-1165","ids":{"shikimori":1165,"mal":1165,"anilist":1165,"kodik":"serial-28505"},"kodikIds":["serial-28520","serial-28505"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28520":"2020-08-08T15:39:50Z","serial-28505":"2020-08-08T15:16:40Z"},"title":"Сакура: Война миров — Великолепие цветущей сакуры","originalTitle":"Sakura Taisen: Ouka Kenran","alt":"サクラ大戦 桜華絢爛 Sakura Wars: The Gorgeous Blooming Cherry Blossoms サクラ大戦 ~桜華絢爛~","description":"Дело происходит примерно в 1920-х годах, и на землю опустилась тьма демонов. Теперь спасти Землю могут лишь люди, обладающие огромным запасом духовной энергии. На борьбу с демонами отправляется Дивизион Цветов — единственная надежда человечества на выживание, вооружённая новейшими паровыми машинами и уникальными боевыми техниками.","year":1997,"type":"OVA","genres":["Приключения","Фантастика","меха","исполнителское искусство"],"rating":6.63,"popularity":3097,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[1166],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1165/8fbd6e054a68c799b7bef0abc8561106.jpeg","width":270,"height":380},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1165-v2FI8ei9CzAc.jpg","width":917,"height":529}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-829","dubId":"829","label":"Animegroup","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":nul